## Development

Requires [rustup](https://rustup.rs) and [just](https://just.systems/); the
toolchain itself is pinned in `rust-toolchain.toml`. `just doctor` lists any
missing cargo tools with install commands.

```sh
just setup   # fetch dependencies, install git hooks
just check   # format check, clippy, tests
just         # list every recipe
```

| Task | Tool |
| --- | --- |
| Build and dependencies | cargo |
| Format and lint | rustfmt, clippy (pedantic, warnings are errors) |
| Tests and coverage | cargo-nextest, cargo-llvm-cov |
| Dependency policy | cargo-deny |
| Docs | rustdoc |
| Git hooks | prek |

The repository carries Claude Code settings (`CLAUDE.md`, `.claude/`): edits
are auto-formatted, `just check` runs before Claude finishes a task, and the
`rust-analyzer-lsp` plugin provides the language server.
